<figure class="workflow-figure">
  <figcaption>One allocation, five ordered responsibilities</figcaption>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Allocation</strong><span>Slurm grants one node and job-scoped resources.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Coordinator</strong><span>The service starts on loopback inside the allocation.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Readiness gate</strong><span>A semantic check must pass before workers start.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Workers</strong><span>Exclusive worker steps start only after readiness.</span></li>
    <li><strong>Verification</strong><span>Result invariants are checked before success is recorded.</span></li>
  </ol>
</figure>
